   `:has()` re-evaluates on `<html>` (an ancestor of both `.nx-shell-root` and
   anything portaled to body) purely from whether a `.nx-shell-root` exists
   ANYWHERE in the document, so it covers portals automatically and needs no
   JS to stay correct across a client-side enter/exit of the dashboard either. */
